          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사용자 테마"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temas do Usuário"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пользовательские темы"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用户主题"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用者主題"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User themes are stored in the iSH-AOK documents directory, under the \"themes\" folder. You can access them within iSH-AOK by running\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\nand manipulating them from there." : {
      "comment" : "Themes list footer under Import Theme; keep the mount command unchanged",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eigene Themes liegen im Dokumentordner von iSH-AOK im Ordner \"themes\". Du kannst in iSH-AOK darauf zugreifen, indem du\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\nausführst und sie dort bearbeitest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los temas de usuario se guardan en el directorio de documentos de iSH-AOK, en la carpeta \"themes\". Puedes acceder a ellos desde iSH-AOK ejecutando\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\ny manipulándolos desde ahí."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les thèmes utilisateur sont stockés dans le répertoire documents d'iSH-AOK, dans le dossier \"themes\". Vous pouvez y accéder depuis iSH-AOK en exécutant\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\net les manipuler depuis cet emplacement."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ユーザテーマは iSH-AOK の書類ディレクトリ内の \"themes\" フォルダに保存されます。iSH-AOK 内で次のコマンドを実行すると\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\nそこからテーマを操作できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사용자 테마는 iSH-AOK 문서 디렉터리의 \"themes\" 폴더에 저장됩니다. iSH-AOK 내에서 다음을 실행하여\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\n해당 위치에서 테마를 다룰 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os temas do usuário são guardados no diretório de documentos do iSH-AOK, na pasta \"themes\". Você pode acessá-los dentro do iSH-AOK executando\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\ne manipulando-os a partir daí."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пользовательские темы хранятся в папке документов iSH-AOK, в подпапке \"themes\". Доступ к ним внутри iSH-AOK можно получить, выполнив\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\nи работая с ними оттуда."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用户主题存储在 iSH-AOK 文稿目录下的“themes”文件夹中。你可以在 iSH-AOK 中运行\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\n然后在该位置管理它们。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用者主題儲存在 iSH-AOK 文件目錄下的 \"themes\" 資料夾中。你可以在 iSH-AOK 中執行\n\n# mount -t real \"$(cat /proc/ish/documents)/themes\" [folder]\n\n然後從那裡管理它們。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
